<title>USA: Chesapeake Energy sells $300 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake Energy sells $300 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt deal was priced in the private placement market from Chesapeake Energy Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to co-lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>Chesapeake Energy explores for and develops gas and oil reserves.</p>
<p>BORROWER</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.875 PCT  MATURITY 3/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.92   FIRST PAY DATE 9/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 7.89 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD 137/7 YR   MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT UST</p>
<p>						    +25 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 8.50 PCT   MATURITY 3/15/2012</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.414  FIRST PAY DATE 9/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BA3   YIELD 8.57 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD 200 BPS    MAKE-WHOLE CALL FOR SEVEN</p>
<p>						 YEARS AT UST +25 BASIS</p>
<p>						 POINTS</p>
<p>((U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
